(506, 'BBM', 'B152C00', 'On Park Brake Release Failure', 'No Sub Type Information', NULL, '1. The digital input of BBM responsible for activating Remote Parking Brake Release Inhibition (function CtaBsPBReleaseInhibit_stat us) was active while vehicle speed was above 10km/h. 2.The digital input of BBM responsible for inhibiting Remote Parking Brake Release Inhibition (function CtaBsPBReleaseInhibCancel _stat) has been active for more than 60s (duration defined by P1KKE).', '11. The digital input of BBM responsible for activating Remote Parking Brake Release Inhibition (function CtaBsPBReleaseInhibit_status) was active while vehicle speed was above 10km/h(speed defined by development parameter P1KKD). This is an assumption that there is a failure in the bodybuilder equipment because function should only be requested at standstill. WORKSHOP ACTION: Recommendation is to check the equipment feeding this BBM digital input. 2. The digital input of BBM responsible for inhibiting Remote Parking Brake Release Inhibition (function CtaBsPBReleaseInhibCancel_stat) has been active for more than 60s (duration defined by P1KKE). This is an assumption that the emergency PB release switch is stucked in position pushed. WORKSHOP ACTION: Recommendation is to check the switch and wire feeding this BBM digital input', 'Remote Park Brake Release Inhibition Error'),
