(931, 'DM', 'B150394', 'Door Control Panel unexpected SW operation executed; Door Control Panel slave watchdog reset performed; Door Control Panel slave overrun situation detected; (Fault Code Indication received from Door Control Panel).', 'Unexpected Operation', NULL, '1. Door Control Panel SW issue; 2. Door Control Panel MCU not correct.', '- Replace the Door Control Panel.', 'Driver Door Control Panel'),
