(958, 'DM', 'B100411', 'Output pin short circuit to GND', 'Circuit Short To Ground', NULL, '1. Harness issue. 2. Actuator motor blown.', '- Inspect the Door Latch. - Inspect the harness and connectors.', 'Door latch actuator circuit 1'),
