(978, 'DM', 'B100919', 'Feedback load current measured on the output is higher than defined threshold. Threshold depends on multiple criteria (voltage, temperature and motor type).', 'Circuit Current Above Threshold', NULL, '1. Mirror actuator issue; 2. Mirror mechanical issue (anormal resistance).', '- Inspect the mirrors. - Inspect the harness and connectors.', 'Main Mirror X adjustment actuator circuit'),
