(1405, 'xBS', 'C109207', 'Difference between left and right pads of an axle > 20%', 'Mechanical Failures', NULL, '- Mechanical fault in the brake calipers - Damaged disc or brake pads. - Damaged Lining wear sensor', 'Measure actual wear values externally. Compare them with the wear values measured by the EBS system (read out via diagnostics). If they match, check brake calipers, disc and pads. calculate wear values, Check lining wear sensor Otherwise check connection resistance between lining wear sensor and EPM, including increased resitance of connectors due to e.g. corrosion.', 'Wheel 8 Braking Monitoring');
