(1458, 'xBS', 'C103F22', 'Sensor signal > range of the sensor', 'Signal Amplitude Greater Than Maximum', NULL, '- Damaged wire(s) or connector(s) - Sensor damaged - EPM damaged - ECU damaged', 'Check the cables and connectors from the ALS to the corresponding EPM (including check for chafing damage). If no error found, check the EoL parameters. If no error found, check with other ALS. If error still active, check with other EPM. If error still active, check with other central ECU.', 'Wheel 1 Axle Load Sensor'),
(1459, 'xBS', 'C103F55', 'ALS is configured but no signal or sensor supply detected.', 'Not Configured', NULL, '- Damaged wire(s) or connector(s) - Sensor damaged - EPM damaged - ECU damaged', 'Check the cables and connectors from the ALS to the corresponding EPM (including check for chafing damage). If no error found, check the EoL parameters. If no error found, check with other ALS. If error still active, check with other EPM (check that the EPM is prepared for ALS connected) . If error still active, check with other central ECU.', 'Wheel 1 Axle Load Sensor'),
