(3273, 'VMCU', 'U300004', '- Internal communication lost with high side and low side drivers. - Communication error indicated by hardware', 'System Internal Failures', NULL, '- Defect VMCU hardware - Defect VMCU software', '1. Reload VMCU SW 2. Check VMCU HW', 'Electronic control unit'),
