(3281, 'VMCU', 'U114688', 'LIN7 network fault (invalid / corrupted headers sent on LIN7).', 'Bus off', NULL, '1. LIN7 wiring harness faulty. 2. RAINS or ESCL faulty. 3. VMCU faulty.', '1. Check wires and connectors 2a. Check RAINS 2b. Check ESCL 3. Check VMCU', 'LIN7 Communication Net'),
